==English==
{{was wotd|2019|February|16}}

===Etymology===
[[File:Real-time MRI - Swallowing (Pineapple Juice).ogv|thumb|A {{w|real-time MRI}} of a person in the process of deglutition, [[swallow#Verb|swallowing]] [[pineapple]] [[juice#Noun|juice]]]]

Borrowed from {{bor|en|fr|déglutition}} or from {{der|en|LL.|dēglūtītiō}}, from {{der|en|la|dēglūtīre}},<ref>{{R:OED Online|part of speech=n|id=49082|date=1894|nodot=yes}}; {{R:Oxford Dictionaries Online}}</ref> {{m|la|dēgluttīre}} + {{m|la|-tiō||''suffix forming nouns relating to actions or the results of actions''}}. ''Dēgluttīre'' is derived from {{m|la|dēgluttiō||to swallow down}}, from {{m|la|dē-||''prefix meaning ‘from, off’''}} + {{m|la|gluttiō||to gulp down, swallow}} (from {{der|en|ine-pro|*gʷel-||throat}}).

